   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Read a file we revise (a co-author's Word file, through the PDF Word makes of it) section by section: one\npicture per section cut from the PDF, the words each planned change touches under a see-through red\nbox, the updated draft's new words under a green one, and a note per change: the change, why, and in\nred the evidence needed and who can answer, written smaller than the pages. The plan in one picture\ncomes first (excalidraw-revise; JL 261011: \"take screen shot of the pdf version for each section and then\nsay what to modify and what to change\"; its own skill since 261013, out of excalidraw-read, whose\npage-cutting helpers it still draws with).",
   "originalText": "Read a file we revise (a co-author's Word file, through the PDF Word makes of it) section by section: one\npicture per section cut from the PDF, the words each planned change touches under a see-through red\nbox, the updated draft's new words under a green one, and a note per change: the change, why, and in\nred the evidence needed and who can answer, written smaller than the pages. The plan in one picture\ncomes first (excalidraw-revise; JL 261011: \"take screen shot of the pdf version for each section and then\nsay what to modify and what to change\"; its own skill since 261013, out of excalidraw-read, whose\npage-cutting helpers it still draws with).",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
